      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ON THE PROWL (1) was in the placings last time but shapes well for this on his outstanding win the start prior, getting around Sandown over 515m in 29.43. Rates on top and can find winning form again. SPENCER BANNER (7) charged out of the boxes with a strong early split and went straight to the front, scoring an all the way win (21.98) over 400m at this track. Yet to miss the placings from four starts out of this box. Form should stack up. PURE MOMENTUM (3) turned in another strong performance after leading to make it two in a row at this track over 472m (26.05). Ran the fastest time on the program in his latest win. Hard to fault his form and he makes plenty of appeal. LOMAX KEEPING (6) has strong credentials over this journey.",
